1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,570
Your HR team answers the same policy questions every day. And every new hire gets a packet built by hand.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,830
Policy Desk answers employees instantly, and every answer cites the exact policy.

3
