5
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,560
Every policy lives in one place, tagged by who it applies to.

6
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,080
The offer letter is a template, with fields filled in for each new hire.

7
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:48,390
One click builds the whole onboarding packet, with only the policies that apply.

8
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:55,140
Unanswered questions show you exactly which policies are missing.

9
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,800
And after one caching fix, each answer costs about two cents.

10
